// ==============================================================================
// VerySync (微力同步) 过滤规则 - YTLiveChat 专项目录
// 目标: E:\MCP\Projects\YTLiveChat\.verysyncignore
// 策略: 保护 Git 双端同步但排除锁；过滤 C#/.NET 编译产物(~238 MB bin/obj/artifacts)
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Git 多端并发安全保护（保留仓库与提交历史，排除锁与瞬态工作态）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/*.lock
**/.git/index.lock
**/.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
**/.git/TAG_EDITMSG
**/.git/FETCH_HEAD
**/.git/ORIG_HEAD
**/.git/rebase-apply
**/.git/rebase-merge
.git/*.lock
.git/index.lock
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. .NET / C# 编译产物与测试中间态 (清理重点: 7处 bin/obj + artifacts ~238 MB)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)bin
(?d)obj
(?d)artifacts
(?d)bld
(?d)publish
(?d)[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
(?d)[Dd]ebug/
(?d)[Rr]elease/
(?d)x64
(?d)x86
(?d)*.pdb
(?d)*.ilk
(?d)*.idb
(?d)*.suo
(?d)*.user
(?d)*.userosscache
(?d)*.sln.docstates
(?d)*.userprefs

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. 通用现代编辑器单机状态与本地临时文件隔离
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Sublime Text
(?d)*.sublime-workspace

// VS Code / Cursor / Zed / Helix / JetBrains / Visual Studio
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d).vscode/ipch
(?d).vscode/.browse.*
(?d).vscode/*.log
(?d).cursor/cache
(?d).cursor/state
(?d).zed/settings.local.json
(?d).helix/*.local.toml
(?d).helix/*.log
(?d).idea
(?d).vs

// Vim / Neovim / 交换文件 / 临时文本 / Office 锁
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d).netrwhist
(?d)~$*
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.bak
(?d)*.log
(?d)*.sync-conflict*
